    "media:imagetext": "LOS ANGELES (Burbank) - SAN FRANCISCO - OAKLAND\nEffective Oct. 15, 1949\nRead Down\nFLIGHT NUMBERS\nNORTHBOUND\n402\n416\n432\n•2416\nLos Angeles.. PST. Lv\n(BURBANK)\n8:00\n12:30\n7:00\n3:30\nSan Francisco ....Ar\n9:48\nSan Francisco\n. Lv\n10:05\nOakland\nAr 10:20\n2:18\n2:35\n2:50\n8:48\n9:00\n9:15\n5:18\n5:35\n5:50\nNow you can fly between Los\nAngeles and San Francisco or\nOakland for the lowest fares\nwith the highest standards of\nsafety, regularity, and con-\nvenience...in DC-4 Coach-\nmasters, chartered from and\noperated by Western Air Lines,\nAmerica's Oldest Certificated\nAirline.\nRead Down\nSOUTHBOUND\nOakland. ... PST. Lv\nSan Francisco.....Ar\nSan Francisco\n....Lv\nLos Angeles .....Ar\n(BURBANK)\n403\n8:30\n8:45\n9:00\n10:48\nFLIGHT NUMBERS\n417\n433\n12:30\n7:15\n12:45\n7:30\n1:00\n7:45\n2:48\n9:33\n•2417\n3:15\n3:30\n3:45\n5:33\nSubject to change without notice\n• Operates Fridays and Sundays only.\nA.M.-Light Figures\nP.M.-Dark Figures\nFOR INTRA-STATE TRAFFIC ONLY\nWESTERN AIR LINES OF CALIFORNIA, INC\nDaily DC-4\nCoachmaster\nfights between\nLOS ANGELES\n(Burbank)\nSAN FRANCISCO\nOAKLAND\nonly\n$O25",
